---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout lang="en" page="partners">
<section class="hero partners-hero reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">For companies</p>
      <h1>No partners, no meetups.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Entry is free for everyone. Partners pay for the venue, food and drinks at each meetup.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose reveal">
    <div class="wrap measure">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Atarazana Founder House is always free for attendees. To make that possible, some companies cover the costs of each meetup: <strong>the venue, food and drinks.</strong></p>
      <p>In return, they visibly support the Málaga tech community without turning the meetup into a commercial event.</p>
      <h2>What you get</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your brand on the website and at the venue of the meetup you sponsor.</li>
        <li>Presence in a room of Málaga founders, engineers and product people who are building.</li>
        <li>A partners’ dinner with the organising team and some of the attendees, with no sales presentations.</li>
        <li>People on your team who are building can request an invite like anyone else, under the same criteria.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What cannot be bought</h2>
      <p>To keep the meetups worth attending, some things are not for sale:</p>
      <ul class="strike">
        <li>A demo slot.</li>
        <li>A talk or keynote.</li>
        <li>Invites for specific people.</li>
        <li>Deciding who gets in.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Options and pricing</h2>
      <p>You can sponsor a single meetup or support us for the whole year. We do not publish prices because they depend on the venue and what each meetup needs: write to us and we will tell you.</p>
      <h2>Getting started</h2>
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:atarazanafh@gmail.com">atarazanafh@gmail.com</a> telling us who you are, what your company does and what you are interested in. We will reply with the available options.</p>
      <hr>
      <a class="cta" href="mailto:atarazanafh@gmail.com?subject=Partners">Write to us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
